<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum</p>
<p>FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks</p>
<p>of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Oct 10-16:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 58.34</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 62.13</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 63.88</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 67.09</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$154.45</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$115.84</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 80.74</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.19</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.12</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.53</p>
</text>
